caption: Mastery Advantages
tradition-component: mastery-advantages

After Dreadhound Mastery:

Loaded Dreadhound abilities may use Master construction rules where appropriate to their source and build.

The chosen Path Power gains general Master access.

The Dreadhound may create Psychic Patterns for entire structural Origins.

Selecting a known Pattern as Current Prey requires only one Concentrate maneuver.

The Dreadhound may replace Psionic, -10%, plus Super, -10%, on Dreadhound abilities with Eldritch, -5%, paying the normal character-point difference. This does not remove other limitations, including Only Against Current Prey.

Dreadhound Mastery satisfies the Tier 2 Tradition-Mastery prerequisite for purchasing Master Psionic. The chosen fixed Path Talent may satisfy Master Psionic's fixed-Talent prerequisite if it is at level 4; all other Master Psionic prerequisites still apply.

Once Master Psionic is purchased, its normal increased fixed-Talent and Psi cap rules apply. Dreadhound Mastery itself grants no free Talent levels, Modular Ability capacity, or character points.
